# This repo is PUBLIC (it has to be, for GitHub Pages to serve the page).
#
# Your list lives in the browser, never in git — but an exported backup or a
# plaintext batch file is your actual content. Committing one would publish it.
# Keep them all out.
*.json

# ...except the inbox, which holds only ciphertext and has to be committed to
# reach the browser. Encrypt with tools/inbox-encrypt.js — never hand-write it.
!inbox.json
